## Join the team

Eagle Span Corporation is always looking for skilled, dedicated people to join
our team of heavy-duty truck and fleet repair specialists. If you want to build
a career somewhere the work is measured and the people are trusted to make
judgement calls, this is a good shop to do it in. We offer competitive
compensation and room to grow.

## How to apply

Send a resume and a short note about your experience. We read every application
properly and contact the candidates we want to interview. There is no closing
date and no specific role you have to match — if you are good at this work, we
want to know.

{% callout tone="note" title="No listed openings right now" %}
Nothing is posted at the moment. That is not the same as nothing being
available: send a resume anyway, because the roles that open here are usually
filled by someone who already got in touch.
{% /callout %}

